Cell["\<\
\"MemoryWeight\" adjusts the balance between minimizing FLOPs vs memory. \
Higher values favor memory reduction.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"76b73afb-a160-48e9-af91-97fe5963e001"],

